{"id":"F12-I1","variant":"CIE","board":"CIE","template":"T19","screen":"N.8","title":"Where does C land?","currency":"","model":{"consts":{"p0":4},"funcs":{"U":["x,y","typ==0 ? ln(x)+ln(y) : (typ==1 ? ln(x)-3*ln(100-y) : ln(x-8)-3*ln(45-y))"],"Uon":["x,p,M","U(x,M-p*x)"],"lo":["p,M","(typ==0 ? 0 : (typ==1 ? max(0,(M-100)/p) : max(8,(M-45)/p)))+1e-6"],"xs":["p,M","argmax(Uon,lo(p,M),M/p-1e-6,p,M)"],"V":["p,M","Uon(xs(p,M),p,M)"],"h":["m","V(px,m)-UA"],"iy":["u,x","typ==0 ? exp(u-ln(x)) : (typ==1 ? 100-exp((ln(x)-u)/3) : 45-exp((ln(x-8)-u)/3))"]},"vars":[["feas0","lo(p0,M)<M/p0-1e-5"],["feas","lo(px,M)<M/px-1e-5"],["ok","feas0 && feas"],["xA","ok ? xs(p0,M) : 0"],["yA","M-p0*xA"],["UA","ok ? U(xA,yA) : 0"],["xC","ok ? xs(px,M) : 0"],["yC","M-px*xC"],["UC","ok ? U(xC,yC) : 0"],["Mc","ok && px!=p0 ? solve(h,1,600) : M"],["xB","ok ? xs(px,Mc) : 0"],["yB","Mc-px*xB"]]},"controls":[{"id":"px","type":"range","label":"Price of X","min":2,"max":8,"start":4,"step":1},{"id":"M","type":"range","label":"Income","min":40,"max":80,"start":60,"step":5},{"id":"typ","type":"seg","label":"Good type (sets the IC map)","options":[{"v":0,"l":"normal"},{"v":1,"l":"inferior"},{"v":2,"l":"Giffen"}],"start":1}],"panels":[{"type":"xy","x":{"label":"Good X","min":0,"max":24,"ticks":[0,5,10,15,20]},"y":{"label":"Good Y","min":0,"max":85,"ticks":[0,20,40,60,80]},"els":[{"t":"line","x1":0,"y1":"M","x2":"M/p0","y2":0,"k":"grey","lab":"BL1"},{"t":"line","x1":0,"y1":"M","x2":"M/px","y2":0,"k":"d","lab":"BL2","if":"px!=p0"},{"t":"line","x1":0,"y1":"Mc","x2":"Mc/px","y2":0,"k":"purple","lab":"compensated","dash":true,"if":"ok && px!=p0"},{"t":"fn","y":"iy(UA,x)","k":"green","lab":"IC1","from":"typ==2 ? 8.05 : 0.5","to":40,"n":100,"if":"ok"},{"t":"fn","y":"iy(UC,x)","k":"green","lab":"IC2","dash":"6 4","from":"typ==2 ? 8.05 : 0.5","to":40,"n":100,"if":"ok && px!=p0"},{"t":"pt","x":"xA","y":"yA","lab":"A","k":"grey","r":5,"if":"ok"},{"t":"pt","x":"xB","y":"yB","lab":"B","k":"purple","r":5,"if":"ok && px!=p0"},{"t":"pt","x":"xC","y":"yC","lab":"C","k":"d","r":5,"show":"checked","if":"ok && px!=p0"},{"t":"arrow","x1":"xA","y1":3,"x2":"xB","y2":3,"k":"purple","lab":"substitution","dy":-8,"anchor":"middle","if":"ok && px!=p0"},{"t":"arrow","x1":"xB","y1":12,"x2":"xC","y2":12,"k":"d","lab":"income","dy":-8,"anchor":"middle","show":"checked","if":"ok && px!=p0"}],"h":290}],"readouts":[{"l":"A (old price 4)","v":"{ok ? \"X \" + fmt(xA,2) : \"—\"}","k":"grey"},{"l":"B (compensated)","v":"{ok && px!=p0 ? \"X \" + fmt(xB,2) : \"—\"}","k":"purple"},{"l":"C (new choice)","v":"{ok && px!=p0 ? \"X \" + fmt(xC,2) : \"—\"}","k":"blue","show":"checked"},{"l":"Note","v":"{ok ? (typ==2 ? \"Giffen map: X is a large part of spending\" : \"\") : \"At this price and income the consumer cannot afford the minimum 8 units of X in the Giffen map: try a price of 3 to 5.\"}","wide":true,"if":"!ok || typ==2"}],"predict":{"q":"X is an **inferior** good, but not a Giffen good, and its price falls (4 → 3). Where is the new choice C?","options":[{"k":"A","s":"To the right of B","fb":"Right of B means more X from higher real income: that is a normal good."},{"k":"B","s":"Between A and B","fb":"The substitution effect (A → B) raises X; the income effect (B → C) lowers it, but by less: C lies between A and B."},{"k":"C","s":"To the left of A","fb":"Left of A means the income effect outweighs the substitution effect: that is the Giffen case, not every inferior good."},{"k":"D","s":"Exactly at B","fb":"At B there would be no income effect at all. A price fall raises real income, and for an inferior good that lowers X."}],"correct":"B"},"task":"With the good type on \"inferior\", move the **price of X** slider down to 3, and watch A and B appear (C appears when you check). Then repeat for \"normal\" and \"Giffen\".","target":{"expr":"typ==1 && px==3 && M==60","do":"Set the good type to \"inferior\" and the price of X to 3 (income 60), then press Check."},"takeaway":"The substitution effect always points 